    <briefdescription>
<para>Runtime utility for resolving launcher runtime artifacts throughout the plugin. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class resolves the launcher runtime in two different scenarios:</para>
<para><bold>Scenario 1: XDK Development (building XDK itself)</bold> <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Plugin has compileOnly + runtimeOnly dependency on javatools </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Gradle automatically supplies launcher artifacts from the composite build </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para><ref refid="d7/da0/classorg_1_1xtclang_1_1plugin_1_1_xtc_java_tools_runtime_1a324aed096a0d3e176bffc40988032b0c" kindref="member">resolveRuntime()</ref> finds the launcher runtime from the composite build </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Plugin has compileOnly dependency on javatools (type info only) </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>User project has XDK distribution as dependency (contains javatools.jar) </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para><ref refid="d7/da0/classorg_1_1xtclang_1_1plugin_1_1_xtc_java_tools_runtime_1a324aed096a0d3e176bffc40988032b0c" kindref="member">resolveRuntime()</ref> finds the launcher runtime from extracted XDK contents </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><bold>Why Two Methods:</bold> <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para><ref refid="d7/da0/classorg_1_1xtclang_1_1plugin_1_1_xtc_java_tools_runtime_1a324aed096a0d3e176bffc40988032b0c" kindref="member">resolveRuntime()</ref> - Finds the full launcher runtime classpath </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para><ref refid="d7/da0/classorg_1_1xtclang_1_1plugin_1_1_xtc_java_tools_runtime_1a3a3370bce69426da09305404a9501942" kindref="member">resolveJavaTools()</ref> - Finds javatools.jar file path (needed for forked processes) </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
